-- The rows one run reads: those after the watermark, the highest ChangeId an
-- earlier run queued. @watermark is the port's InitialWatermark on the
-- first run. Replace the table and columns with the source's; keep the
-- @watermark filter and the ORDER BY on the watermark column, and change the
-- column in Composition (Delta.Column) with them.
--
-- The same query runs against SQL Server when deployed and SQLite locally, so
-- keep to SQL both accept: no schema prefix, no TOP, no T-SQL functions.
SELECT ChangeId, RecordId, ChangedAt
FROM ChangeLog
WHERE ChangeId > @watermark
ORDER BY ChangeId;
